\section{iptic curve schemes\labelct::ecc}}
In the following section we compute the space/time tradeoffs for attacking public-key cryptographic schemes based on solving the discrete logarithm 
problem in finite groups generated over elliptic curves, namely NIST P-160, NIST P-192,IST P-224,IST P-26,IST P-384 andIST P-521. For 
